          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 79126,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tahu cara mengulangi kode menggunakan loop <code>while</code>. Seperti program ini yang mengulangi pernyataan untuk menampilkan Bendera Amerika.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"first_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"second_counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" second_counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  second_counter += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan menggunakan <strong>for loops</strong>, kita bisa menulis program dengan kode yang jauh lebih sedikit dan membuatnya lebih mudah dipahami oleh programmer lain.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79131,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat loop <code>for</code> seperti ini, tambahkan keyword <code>for</code>, variabel seperti <code>i</code>, kata <code>in</code>, dan terakhir <code>range():</code></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range():\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, lalu <code>in</code>, <code>range():</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79130,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam loop <code>for</code>, kita bisa menentukan berapa kali kita ingin loop berjalan dengan pernyataan <code>range()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy birthday to you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Happy birthday to you!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>range</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambahkan angka seperti <code>6</code> di dalam <code>range()</code> berarti kode akan mengulang blok kode sebanyak 6 kali, dari <code>0</code> hingga <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>range</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>6</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angka di dalam <code>range()</code> menentukan berapa kali loop berjalan, mulai dari <code>0</code>. Buat agar menampilkan <code>0</code> sampai <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>range</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>6</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 79167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel sebelum <code>in</code>, dalam hal ini, <code>i</code>, adalah variabel penghitung. Variabel ini menghitung pengulangan ke berapa dari loop yang sedang kita jalankan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel sebelum <code>in</code>, yaitu <code>i</code>, adalah variabel counter. Variabel ini menghitung pengulangan loop saat ini.</p><p>Cetak counter agar <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, dan <code>2</code> muncul sebelum <code>For loops are great!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;For loops are great!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"For loops are great!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 79124,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis loop apa yang dimiliki ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop <code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode ini menggunakan loop <code>for</code>. Mengapa <code>Are you ready?</code> muncul empat kali?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range (\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Are you ready?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Are you ready?\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop berjalan sekali untuk setiap nilai yang dihasilkan <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop <code>for</code> selalu berjalan empat kali, terlepas dari range.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Variabel penghitung <code>i</code> menampilkan pesan empat kali sebelum loop dimulai.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop berjalan sekali untuk setiap nilai yang dihasilkan <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 79123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ke mana perginya variabel loop dalam loop <code>for</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebelum keyword <code>in</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setelah pernyataan <code>range()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebelum keyword <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel loop dalam loop <code>for</code> berada sebelum kata kunci <code>in</code>.</p><p>Header mana yang menggunakan <code>step</code> sebagai variabel loop untuk tiga pengulangan?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for step in range(3):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for in step range(3):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(3) in step:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for step in range(3):</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 79122,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel mana yang menjadi variabel penghitung dari loop <code>for</code>? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dalam loop <code>for</code> ini, <code>i</code> adalah variabel penghitung.</p><p>Jika <code>print(i)</code> berada di dalam loop, nilai mana yang ditampilkannya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code>, lalu <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, lalu <code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>range</code>, lalu <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>0</code>, lalu <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 79121,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa kali <code>be like me</code> akan muncul di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">3</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">4</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih 3.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perubahan mana yang membuat <code>be like me</code> muncul empat kali tanpa mengubah bagian kode lainnya?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody wants to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody wants to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ubah <code>range(3)</code> menjadi <code>range(4)</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pindahkan <code>print(\"Everybody wants to\")</code> ke dalam loop.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ubah <code>range(3)</code> menjadi <code>range(2)</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ubah <code>range(3)</code> menjadi <code>range(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing",
            "id": 79120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Variabel penghitungnya hilang setelah kata kunci <code>for</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kodenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Variabel penghitungnya hilang setelah kata kunci <code>for</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop <code>for</code> memerlukan variabel penghitung setelah kata kunci <code>for</code>.</p><p>Pengganti mana yang memperbaiki baris pertama agar <code>i</code> tersedia saat loop berjalan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for i in range(5):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for range(5) in i:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for i range(5):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for i in range(5):</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For keyword",
            "id": 79118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menyusun struktur loop <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, lalu <code>range</code>, <code>(4)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat header loop agar berulang empat kali dan menampilkan <code>Updating accounts...</code> pada setiap putaran.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Updating accounts...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(5)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Updating accounts...\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, <code>range</code>, dan terakhir <code>(4)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
